SUMMARY:For MH\, MP\, FMSD Staff: K-8 Avanza + Boost
LOCATION:Voices College-Bound Language Academy\, Hellyer Avenue\, San Jose\, CA\, USA
DESCRIPTION:In this in-person session\, educators will get hands-on training with Vista’s Avanza and Boost platforms to set their ELD/SLD block up for success at the start of the school year. Teachers will learn how to navigate both digital systems and leverage their key tools to drive effective\, language-rich instruction from day one.
